  The reel_script says the leopard entered the residential area at Rottikkadai, but the article says the leopard was walking on a pedestrian path in the residential area; the headline and script state it 'entered' the residence, which is a slight shift, though the article says it entered the residential area at evening — acceptable.
  The reel_script states 'சிறுத்தை வீடுகளில் வளர்க்கப்படும் பிராணிகளை உணவுக்காகக் கவ்விச் செல்வது வழக்கமாகிவிட்டது' and mentions the leopard 'பதுங்குகிறது' near the anganwadi, but the article attributes the hiding to the overgrown bushes as a cause observed by residents—this is presented as a claim by residents, which the script does state; no clear error there.
  The caption and reel_script say the leopard entered the residential area 'இரவில்' (at night) in slides_spec: 'இரவில் குடியிருப்புக்குள் சிறுத்தை நுழைவது வழக்கமாகிவிட்டது' — the article says the leopard enters the residential area at night, so this matches; however the slides_spec line also places the event in the evening, mixing time references in one sentence, which is a minor concern.
